	 (4444,'Braid [Online Game Code]','Braid','https://store.steampowered.com/app/26800/Braid/','Casual,Indie,Strategy','["Video Games", "Xbox 360", "Digital Games & DLC", "Digital Games", "</span></span></span>", "The game doesn''t force you to solve puzzles in order to proceed. If you can''t figure something out, just play onward and return to that puzzle later.", "Enjoy 2D platforming action where you can never die and never lose. But you will always be challenged.", "Travel through worlds, solving thought inducing puzzles by manipulating time: rewinding, creating parallel universes, setting up pockets of dilated time.", "Experience Braid''s painterly art style and lush organic soundtrack.", "A nonlinear fiction links the various worlds and provides real-world metaphors for your time manipulations, creating \"what-if\" universes where consequences can be explored."]','["Puzzle,Platformer,Indie,Time Manipulation,2D,Puzzle-Platformer,Singleplayer,Great Soundtrack,Difficult,Masterpiece,Time Travel,Casual,Atmospheric,Classic,Strategy,Story Rich,Beautiful,Side Scroller,Adventure,Controller"]','braid');
