	 (15312,'Grim Dawn [Download]','Grim Dawn','https://store.steampowered.com/app/219990/Grim_Dawn/','Action,Adventure,Indie,RPG','["Video Games", "PC", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "Dual class - combine any of five distinct skill classes each with multiple skill trees in which to specialize. Advance your class mastery to unlock over 25 powerful skills and synergistic modifiers per class.", "Collect hundreds of items in common, magical, rare, epic and legendary classes of loot. Over 275 unique item granted skills allow for an unprecedented degree of build customization.", "Quests with Choice and consequence mean you will face tough decisions that leave significant impacts upon the world. Strangers on the road, desperate families and even entire villages may live or perish based on your actions.", "Recruit survivors from the wilderness and gain favor with different NPC factions to rebuild towns, unlock additional quest lines and earn perks like merchant discounts."]','["Action RPG,Dark Fantasy,Hack and Slash,RPG,Loot,Dungeon Crawler,Dark,Co-op,Multiplayer,Singleplayer,Fantasy,Action,Adventure,Atmospheric,Isometric,Post-apocalyptic,Indie,Zombies,Kickstarter,Crowdfunded"]','grim dawn'),
