	 (15562,'Guild Wars Nightfall (Bonus Pack - Presell)','Guild Wars Nightfall','https://store.steampowered.com/app/29580/Guild_Wars_Nightfallsupsup/','RPG,Massively Multiplayer','["Video Games", "PC", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "Guild Wars \"Play Now\" key for a 10-hour/14-day trial of Guild Wars Prophecies and Guild Wars Factions (maximum of 10 hours of game play over a 14 day period from the time the code is activated)", "Guild Wars Nightfall Bonus Key, providing one additional character slot for a Guild Wars Nightfall account, as well as two exclusive items for the new professions", "Items: Fiery Sunspear of Shelter (for the new Paragon profession) and an Icy Soulbreaker of Enchanting (for the new Dervish)", "Mini strategy guide, concept art, screenshots, in-game renders of characters and items, preview trailer, wallpapers, lore, quick reference card, music, and more!"]','["Massively Multiplayer,RPG"]','guild wars nightfall'),
