	 (17151,'上帝之城 I：监狱帝国 [City of God I - Prison Empire]','上帝之城 I：监狱帝国 [City of God I - Prison Empire]','https://store.steampowered.com/app/466860/_I_City_of_God_I__Prison_Empire/','Indie,RPG,Simulation,Strategy','[]','["Simulation,Indie,RPG,Strategy,Management,Pixel Graphics,Early Access"]','i'),
	 (17152,'I Am Alive [Download]','I Am Alive','https://store.steampowered.com/app/214250/I_Am_Alive/','Action,Adventure','["Video Games", "PC", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "The new Easy mode provides infinite retries and a slightly softer, more forgiving introduction to I Am Alive. With the Replay mode, go back and replay any level any time to uncover more secrets, alternate path, and hidden resources.", "Explore the dark, atmospheric post-apocalyptic world in higher resolutions and sharper graphics than ever, with fully customizable graphics settings.", "Fully configurable mouse, keyboard and game pad support to play the way you like.", "Combat is deadly and ammo is scarce. Use deception to deal with group of enemies while trying to keep your precious few bullets, but watch out for the toughest ones may call your bluff.", "Extreme Survival: Every effort has its cost. Manage your stamina and your few precious resources and supplies skillfully."]','["Survival,Post-apocalyptic,Action,Adventure,Third Person,Singleplayer,Parkour,Atmospheric,Dark,Third-Person Shooter,Open World,Shooter,FPS,Horror,Platformer,Action-Adventure,Masterpiece,Survival Horror"]','i am alive'),
	 (17153,'I am Bread [Online Game Code]','I am Bread','https://store.steampowered.com/app/327890/I_am_Bread/','Action,Adventure,Indie,Simulation','["Video Games", "Digital Games", "PC", "</span></span></span>", "Story Mode: Embark on an epic journey to become toast! From the kitchen, through the house, to the lounge, and then venture outside into the garden and beyond.", "Bagel Race: Satisfy your taste for speed and bagels as you race across the checkpoints in each level and complete the tracks in the fastest possible time.", "Rampage: Cause as much destruction as possible throughout the house as you smash everything in sight as (possibly) angry baguette.", "Zero-G: Literally bread in space! Make studious use of your bread boosters as you manoeuvre across environments with no gravity!", "Free-play: Explore the world and play as any of the bread types you have unlocked, having crumby fun in your own sweet time."]','["Simulation,Funny,Physics,Comedy,Adventure,Difficult,Indie,Singleplayer,Controller,Action,Cute,Casual,Masterpiece,Family Friendly,Third Person,Intentionally Awkward Controls,Epic,3D Platformer,Early Access,Beautiful"]','i am bread'),
