	 (18254,'Judge Dredd: Dredd vs. Death (Windows)','Judge Dredd: Dredd vs. Death','https://store.steampowered.com/app/3710/Judge_Dredd_Dredd_vs_Death/','Action','["Video Games", "PC", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "In this thrilling first-person shooter, you''ll become the famous sci-fi Character Judge Dredd. Be judge, jury and executioner for 11 wild, violent and exciting chapters", "Try to keep order in a rough time in Mega-One''s history - unemployment is high -- everyone''s broke, bored & pissed off. As the city of 400,000,000 threatens to explode, Judge Death brings his brand of capital punishment to all citizens.", "Bring justice down on crooks with the Lawgiver -- a multi-purpose gun you can equip with incendiary bullets, armor piercers, stun gas grenades, ricochet rounds and more", "Interact with 50 strange, sick and unique characters - from average crooks & mad scientists to undead Judges and face zombies", "Sixteen intense multiplayer missions, with ead-to-head action for 1-4 players"]','["Action,FPS,Cyberpunk,First-Person,Singleplayer,Gore,Classic,Sci-fi,Shooter,Comic Book,Story Rich"]','judge dredd dredd vs death'),
