	 (18860,'Knights and Merchants','Knights and Merchants','https://store.steampowered.com/app/253900/Knights_and_Merchants/','Simulation,Strategy','["Video Games", "Mac", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "You are the captain of the palace guard, and with the King himself unable to lead his forces to war against the rogue prince, responsibility for defense of the realm falls on you.", "To do this, you''ll need to draw from your tactical & management skills", "Develop a trade system and take towns from poverty to prosperity", "Use the tax money from this system to equip your soldiers and train them in the arts of war", "Then lead your men to war against the rival forces in a bloody civil war -- use your strategy to emerge victorious over the rebels and bring peace to the land!"]','["Strategy,Medieval,RTS,City Builder,Classic,Simulation,Singleplayer,Historical,Multiplayer,Masterpiece,Cult Classic,Old School,Great Soundtrack,Resource Management,Management,Difficult,2D,Economy"]','knights and merchants'),
