	 (19399,'LEGO Harry Potter: Years 1-4','LEGO® Harry Potter: Years 1-4','https://store.steampowered.com/app/21130/LEGO_Harry_Potter_Years_14/','Action,Adventure','["Video Games", "Mac", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "Enormous game which offers a faithful, affectionate and humorous recreation of the world of Harry Potter.", "More than 100 playable character and many with special abilities, such as Harry''s invisibility cloak, Hermione''s talent for solving tricky puzzles.", "Hundreds of hidden secrets to find, puzzles to solve and challenges to complete that require lateral thinking.", "Face off against mighty bosses in epic confrontations - including Lord Voldemort - He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named - himself.", "True co-operative multiplayer - the second player can drop in and out at will with a seamless split-screen camera control for two-player mode."]','["LEGO,Adventure,Action,Local Co-Op,Magic,Family Friendly,Singleplayer,Fantasy,Comedy,Funny,Open World,Split Screen,Puzzle,Multiplayer,Co-op,Controller,Third Person,Local Multiplayer"]','lego harry potter years 14'),
