	 (19401,'Lego Indiana Jones 2: The Adventure Continues','LEGO® Indiana Jones™ 2: The Adventure Continues','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32450/LEGO_Indiana_Jones_2_The_Adventure_Continues/','Adventure','["Video Games", "Xbox 360", "Games"]','["LEGO,Adventure,Action,Local Co-Op,Family Friendly,Comedy,Singleplayer,Open World,Co-op,Level Editor,Funny"]','lego indiana jones 2 the adventure continues'),
	 (19402,'LEGO Indiana Jones 2: The Adventure Continues','LEGO® Indiana Jones™ 2: The Adventure Continues','https://store.steampowered.com/app/32450/LEGO_Indiana_Jones_2_The_Adventure_Continues/','Adventure','["Video Games", "Mac", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "Six enormous level hubs see you adventuring through the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull and scenes from the classic films", "Take control of over 60 characters, including Marion Ravenwood, Short Round, Mutt, Belloq, Dr Jones Sr., and of course, Indy", "New vehicles to help you through tricky terrain, including planes, boats, trucks, and mine carts", "Co-operative play allows a second player to drop in and out at any time", "Brand-new level designer lets you build your own adventures, brick by brick"]','["LEGO,Adventure,Action,Local Co-Op,Family Friendly,Comedy,Singleplayer,Open World,Co-op,Level Editor,Funny"]','lego indiana jones 2 the adventure continues'),
