	 (20380,'Mafia III [Online Game Code]','Mafia III','https://store.steampowered.com/app/360430/Mafia_III/','Action,Adventure','["Video Games", "PC", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "1968 NEW BORDEAUX, A REIMAGINED NEW ORLEANS: A vast open world ruled by the mob and detailed with the sights and sounds of the era.", "A LETHAL ANTI-HERO: Be Lincoln Clay, orphan and Vietnam veteran hell bent on revenge for the deaths of his surrogate family.", "REVENGE YOUR WAY: Choose your own play-style; brute force, blazing guns or stalk-and-kill tactics, to tear down the Italian Mafia.", "A NEW FAMILY ON THE ASHES OF THE OLD: Build a new criminal empire your way by deciding which lieutenants you reward, and which you betray"]','["Crime,Open World,Action,Story Rich,Singleplayer,Third Person,Violent,Atmospheric,Shooter,Great Soundtrack,Third-Person Shooter,Adventure,Stealth,Nudity,Classic,Multiplayer,Sandbox,Mature,Gore,FPS"]','mafia iii'),
