	 (30410,'Shadowrun Returns [Online Game Code]','Shadowrun Returns','https://store.steampowered.com/app/234650/Shadowrun_Returns/','Adventure,Indie,RPG,Strategy','["Video Games", "Digital Games", "PC", "</span></span></span>", "Gripping Tactical Combat: When youre running the shadows, every turn matters. With the variety of weapons and spells at your disposal, every turn is filled with meaningful choices.", "Skill-Based Character Progression: Street Samurai and Physical Adepts use advanced combat skills, Shamans and Mages summon powerful allies and cast deadly spells, while Riggers and Deckers provide critical technological support.", "Engaging 2D/3D Art Style: Mixing dynamic 3D characters and lighting with a vibrant, hand-painted environment. Explore a world filled with detail, from the slums of the Redmond Barrens to the extravagant offices of powerful corporations."]','["RPG,Cyberpunk,Turn-Based,Isometric,Sci-fi,Indie,Strategy,Singleplayer,Tactical,Kickstarter,Moddable,Adventure,CRPG,Story Rich,Crowdfunded,Fantasy,Atmospheric,Turn-Based Strategy,Dystopian,Female Protagonist"]','shadowrun returns'),
