	 (34771,'The Cerberus Project: Horde Arena FPS','The Cerberus Project: Horde Arena FPS','https://store.steampowered.com/app/662870/The_Cerberus_Project_Horde_Arena_FPS/','Action,Indie','[]','["Action,Indie,Swordplay,Arena Shooter,Fast-Paced,Colorful,FPS"]','the cerberus project horde arena fps'),
