	 (34775,'The Chaos Engine [Online Game Code]','The Chaos Engine','https://store.steampowered.com/app/242530/The_Chaos_Engine/','Action','["Video Games", "PC", "Games", "</span></span></span>", "Battle through four unique worlds in single player or online and local co-op modes.", "Play in ''Enhanced mode'' or ''Classic mode'' with its original graphics and controls for the true Amiga experience.", "Gamepad support with optional 16-directional movement.", "Steam achievements to test the mettle of both new players and old fans.", "Relive the classic 90''s Richard Joseph soundtrack."]','["Action,Retro,Co-op,Steampunk,Top-Down,Shooter,Classic,Singleplayer,2D"]','the chaos engine'),
